Standalone software

Original standalone software is licensed under the PolyForm Noncommercial
License 1.0.0 (LICENSES/PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0.txt).

Trime and corresponding source

The vendored Trime v3.3.13 configuration, the derived *.trime.yaml files,
and the Trime patch in tools/patches/ are licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later
(LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt). The derived themes expand Trime's default
configuration and apply this project's keyboard and appearance overrides
(2026-11-11). Their corresponding source is available under GPL-3.0-or-later
in rime/theme/sources/, rime/theme/vendor/, tools/check_trime.py,
tools/render_keyboard.py, and tools/theme_build/.

Third-party assets

Fonts retain the licenses listed in rime/fonts/README.md. The Material
Design globe and clipboard icons retain Apache-2.0 (rime/fonts/Apache-2.0.txt).
The typewriter recording is from nvmbky under CC0, as noted in
rime/soundeffect/v2-typewriter.sound.yaml. These and other third-party
materials retain their respective licenses and notices.
